# Selecting a profile
* Ctrl+Shift+P
* ESP-IDF: SDK Configuration Editor
* Project Hardware
* Select Display

## 1 - USER_DISPLAY_ST7796S "ST7796S 480x320 3.5in - colorful UI"

* TENSTAR ROBO 3.5 Inch 320x480 SPI TFT Serial Port Module 5V/3.3V PCB Adapter ST7789V/ST7796S LCD Display
* https://th.aliexpress.com/item/1005006175220737.html
* TFT GPIO: MOSI=10 SCLK=9 MISO=-1 CS=13 DC=12 RST=11 BL=14
### UI
![UI](docs/images/Profile1_UI.jpg)
### Display
![Display](docs/images/ST7796S_480x320_3.5in.jpg)

## 2 - USER_DISPLAY_ST7796S_TEST "ST7796S 480x320 - test UI"
* Copy of the previous display, for future use 

## 3 - USER_DISPLAY_ST7789_HW657A "ST7789 170x320 - HW657A - Simple UI"
* ESP32 -WROOM-32 Development Board 1.9in/1.14in ST7789 170x320 TFT LCD Display,WiFi+BL Module CH340
* * TFT GPIO: MOSI=23 SCLK=18 MISO=-1 CS=15 DC=2 RST=4 BL=32
* https://th.aliexpress.com/item/1005008660741121.html
### Board with Display
![Display](docs/images/ESP32-WROOM-32_1.14in_1.9in_TFT_LCD.png)

